#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path, on each poller that reads nodes, to the private key whose public half each node lists in authorized_keys with a forced command running pfs-read.sh. Readable only by the poller user. The plugin never creates, copies, or prints it."
msgstr "Waddada buuxda, ee poller kasta oo akhriya noodhyada, ee tagta furaha gaarka ah kaas oo qaybtiisa guud noodh kastaa ku qoro authorized_keys iyadoo leh amar qasab ah oo wada pfs-read.sh. Waxaa akhrin kara oo keliya isticmaalaha poller-ka. Plugin-ku waligiis ma abuuro, ma koobiyeeyo, mana daabaco."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SSH Key File"
msgstr "Faylka Furaha SSH"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the known_hosts file holding each node host key under the node endpoint name. A node whose key is missing or changed is not read."
msgstr "Waddada buuxda ee tagta faylka known_hosts ee haya furaha martigeliyaha noodh kasta oo hoos yimaada magaca barta dhamaadka noodhka. Noodhka furihiisu maqan yahay ama isbeddelay lama akhriyo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Known Hosts File"
