msgstr "Waqtiga Dhammaadka Xiriirka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds to wait for a node to accept the connection."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyada la sugayo inta noodhku aqbalayo xiriirka."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Read Timeout"
msgstr "Waqtiga Dhammaadka Akhriska"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node read may take in total before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyada uu hal akhris noodh qaadan karo guud ahaan ka hor inta aan la joojin oo aan loo diiwaangelin inuu fashilmay."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one node may return. A larger answer is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "KiB ee hal noodh soo celin karo. Jawaab ka weyn waa la tuuraa waxaana loo diiwaangeliyaa inay fashilantay."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response"
msgstr "Jawaabta Ugu Badan"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Akhriye"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader Time Budget"
msgstr "Miisaaniyadda Waqtiga Akhriyaha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one reader run may spend before it stops starting node reads. Keep it below the poller interval; unread nodes are read on the next run."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyada uu hal socod oo akhriye ah qaadan karo ka hor inta uusan joojin bilaabista akhriska noodhyada. Ka dhig mid ka hooseeya muddada poller-ka; noodhyada aan la akhrin waxaa la akhriyaa socodka xiga."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Concurrent Reads"
msgstr "Akhrisyada Isbarbar-socda"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node reads one reader runs at the same time."
msgstr "Akhrisyada noodhka ee hal akhriye wada wado isku mar."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Ka saar"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Ilaali Jadwalka Plugin-ka Marka La Saarayo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its filesystems, nodes, inventory, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the registry first from the Parallel Filesystem Admin page. Storage nodes are never contacted either way."
msgstr "Marka la calaamadiyo, ka-saarista plugin-ka waxay haynaysaa nidaamyadiisa faylalka, noodhyada, diiwaanka hantida, iyo kaydka. Ka saar calaamadda si ka-saaristu u tirtirto; marka hore ka dhoofi diiwaanka bogga Maamulka Parallel Filesystem. Noodhyada kaydinta waligood lala ma xiriiro si kastaba ha ahaatee."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delete the Devices This Plugin Created on Uninstall"
msgstr "Tirtir Qalabyada Plugin-kan Abuuray Marka La Saaro"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin deletes the devices it created for filesystems, with their graphs and data sources, as deleting them in Cacti would. Existing devices that were mapped to a filesystem are never deleted. RRD files are removed only if Cacti's own RRD cleanup setting removes them. Cleared, the devices stay."
msgstr "Marka la calaamadiyo, ka-saarista plugin-ku waxay tirtiraysaa qalabyada uu u abuuray nidaamyada faylalka, iyada oo ay la socdaan garaafyadiisa iyo ilaha xogta, sida ka-tirtiridda Cacti oo kale. Qalabyada jira ee lagu xidhay nidaam faylal waligood lama tirtiro. Faylasha RRD waxaa la saaraa oo keliya haddii dejinta nadiifinta RRD ee Cacti ay saarto. Haddii calaamadda laga saaro, qalabyadu way sii joogayaan."

#: lib/TargetsPage.php
msgid "No filesystem is visible to you."
msgstr "Ma jiro wax nidaam faylal ah oo kuu muuqda."

#: lib/TargetsPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Filesystem %s"
msgstr "Nidaamka Faylalka %s"

#: lib/TargetsPage.php
msgid "Graphs of this filesystem"
msgstr "Garaafyada nidaamkan faylalka"

#: lib/TargetsPage.php
msgid "Condition"
msgstr "Xaaladda"

#: lib/TargetsPage.php
msgid "Freshness"
msgstr "Cusboonaanta"

#: lib/TargetsPage.php
msgid "Known Values"
msgstr "Qiimayaasha La Yaqaan"

#: lib/TargetsPage.php
msgid "Last Seen"
msgstr "Markii Ugu Dambaysay ee La Arkay"

#: lib/TargetsPage.php
msgid "Recovery"
msgstr "Soo Kabashada"

#: lib/TargetsPage.php
msgid "Review"
msgstr "Dib-u-eegis"

#: lib/TargetsPage.php
msgid "Source Node"
msgstr "Noodhka Isha"

#: lib/TargetsPage.php
msgid "No targets found yet."
msgstr "Weli lama helin wax bartilmaameedyo ah."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "That record belongs to a Cacti device you do not have permission for. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "Diiwaankaas wuxuu leeyahay qalab Cacti ah oo aadan u lahayn ogolaansho. Waxba lama beddelin."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Name: another filesystem of this backend already uses this name."
msgstr "Magaca: nidaam faylal kale oo ka tirsan backend-kan ayaa horay u isticmaalay magacan."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem could not be saved."
msgstr "Nidaamka faylalka lama kaydin karin."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem was saved."
msgstr "Nidaamka faylalka waa la kaydiyay."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem, its nodes, and its inventory were deleted. Its Cacti device, data sources, and graphs were kept. No node was contacted."
msgstr "Nidaamka faylalka, noodhyadiisa, iyo diiwaankiisa hantida waa la tirtiray. Qalabkiisa Cacti, ilaha xogta, iyo garaafyada waa la hayay. Wax noodh ah lala ma xiriirin."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Name: another node already uses this name."
msgstr "Magaca: noodh kale ayaa horay u isticmaalay magacan."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node could not be saved."
msgstr "Noodhka lama kaydin karin."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was saved."
msgstr "Noodhka waa la kaydiyay."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was deleted. Targets it reported keep their history."
msgstr "Noodhka waa la tirtiray. Bartilmaameedyadii uu soo sheegay waxay haystaan taariikhdooda."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Enter a network as an address and prefix length, such as 10.20.0.0/16."
msgstr "Geli shabakad sida ciwaan iyo dhererka horgalaha, sida 10.20.0.0/16."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "No device was added: the filesystem already has one, or the templates are not installed."
msgstr "Wax qalab ah laguma darin: nidaamka faylalku horay ayuu mid u lahaa, ama qaab-dhismeedyada lama rakibin."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device could not be mapped. It may be mapped to another filesystem."
msgstr "Qalabka lama xidhi karin. Waxaa laga yaabaa inuu ku xidhan yahay nidaam faylal kale."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device was mapped and the data queries and overview graphs were added."
msgstr "Qalabka waa la xidhay waxaana lagu daray weydimaha xogta iyo garaafyada guud."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Cacti did not create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Cacti ma abuurin qalabka. Eeg diiwaanka Cacti."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device, its data queries, and its overview graphs were created."
msgstr "Qalabka, weydimaha xogtiisa, iyo garaafyadiisa guud waa la abuuray."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device is no longer mapped. It and its graphs were kept; its data queries list no targets until it is mapped again."
msgstr "Qalabku hadda ma xidhna. Isaga iyo garaafyadiisa waa la hayay; weydimaha xogtiisu ma taxaan wax bartilmaameedyo ah ilaa mar kale la xidho."

#: pfs_health.php
msgid "The templates and data query files were installed."
msgstr "Qaab-dhismeedyada iyo faylasha weydiinta xogta waa la rakibay."

#: pfs_health.php
